            "review_title": "Review at Lotteria",
            "review_text": "Juan D\nDa Nang, Vietnam21 contributions\n0\nResembles Western Fast Food.\nMay 2020\nThe food resembles the style of Western fast food places. The have a wide selection of burgers (which mostly all taste the same) and chicken like chicken nuggets, chicken poppers, chicken wings, etc. But the food is always bland and even lacks flavor compared to places like KFC and McDonald's. \n\nStaff are not really friendly, and orders often take longer to make than you would expect from a fast food place. Staff also sometimes forget to bring your order to your table and you have to follow up sometimes. \n\nPrice for value menu and standard items is reasonable but other premium items can add up in price quickly if your order more than one. Go if you want an average western fast food experience. I go because it reminds me of fast food like back home. But KFC tastes much better. Lotteria is also in Tam Ky but beside a location with better ambiance it is much the same experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 30, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
