            "review_title": "Review at Lotteria",
            "review_text": "Aussieeod\n1012 contributions\n0\nThe blueberry tornados are divine\nJan 2019 • Family\nThere are a number of Lotterias in Da Nang. The one in the Big C shopping center is probably the easiest to find. Think: McDonald's only much better. They serve a mixture of Western and Asian foods. Their chicken is particularly good. The counters have menus in English so you can point out what you want if language is a problem. The stores are air conditioned with comfortable seating. Their version of a McFlurry is called a tornado and it comes in 5 different flavours but I can't go past the blueberry. It is divine. Their soft serves too are awesome and it is all very reasonably priced. I hope that the golden arches never reach Vietnam as it would drive this much better place out of business.\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
