            "review_title": "Review at Lotteria",
            "review_text": "Gio F\nManama, Bahrain948 contributions\n1\nTried thr the one in lotte mart, give it pass in your Vietnam visit\nFeb 2018 • Couples\nWent there out of curiosity even though I don't really go for fast food places on vacation, but since I heard how it was big in Vietnam and I was at the mall so decided to try their burgers and food.\n\nNo taste and flavor, more processed than back home... plus with the price, you can get a much better local food around.\n\nIf you're wanting to try it out of curiosity like me, I say skip it. The fries were nice though, but skip the powder thingy that comes with it.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2018",
